egin="0:47.220" end="0:52.731" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.220" end="0:47.909">Căci</span> <span begin="0:47.909" end="0:48.139">ce</span> <span begin="0:48.139" end="0:49.976">zice</span> <span begin="0:49.976" end="0:50.894">Legea</span> <span begin="0:50.894" end="0:52.731">Ta</span></p><p begin="0:52.731" end="0:58.242" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.731" end="0:53.190">Ca</span> <span begin="0:53.190" end="0:53.650">să</span> <span begin="0:53.650" end="0:55.027">fac</span> <span begin="0:55.027" end="0:55.486">eu</span> <span begin="0:55.486" end="0:55.946">n-aș</span> <span begin="0:55.946" end="0:58.242">putea,</span></p><p begin="0:58.242" end="1:03.753" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.242" end="0:58.701">Chiar</span> <span begin="0:58.701" end="1:00.538">s-alerg,</span> <span begin="1:00.538" end="1:00.997">să</span> <span begin="1:00.997" end="1:01.456">lupt</span> <span begin="1:01.456" end="1:01.916">cât</span> <span begin="1:01.916" end="1:03.753">pot,</span></p><p begin="1:03.753" end="1:09.263" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.753" end="1:04.212">Și</span> <span begin="1:04.212" end="1:04.671">să</span> <span begin="1:04.671" end="1:06.049">plâng</span> <span begin="1:06.049" end="1:06.967">amar</span> <span begin="1:06.967" end="1:07.426">de</span> <span begin="1:07.426" end="1:09.263">tot;</span></p><p begin="1:09.263" end="1:14.774" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.263" end="1:10.182">Dacă</span> <span begin="1:10.182" end="1:12.019">harul</span> <span begin="1:12.019" end="1:12.707">Tău</span> <span begin="1:12.707" end="1:12.937">n-ar</span> <span begin="1:12.937" end="1:14.774">fi,</span></p><p begin="1:14.774" end="1:21.605" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.774" end="1:15.233">Știu</span> <span begin="1:15.233" end="1:15.692">că</span> <span begin="1:15.692" end="1:17.070">nu</span> <span begin="1:17.070" end="1:17.529">m-aș</span> <span begin="1:17.529" end="1:21.605">mântui.</span></p><p begin="1:21.605" end="1:27.143" ttm:agent="v1"